ght:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>；PG III 当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>60</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23\\,^\\circ\\text{C} \\le T_f \\le 60\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>35</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_b &gt; 35\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>。写成可编程判定：先看初沸点是否低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，是则 PG I；否则看闪点是否低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>23</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">23\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，是则 PG II，否（且不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>）则 PG III。闪点超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\,^\\circ\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的液体通常已不属于 Class 3。</p>\n<p>其他类别判据各不相同：6.1 类按急性毒性（口服 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LD_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、皮肤 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LD_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、吸入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LC_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）分档，8 类按对完整皮肤的毁损程度与接触时间分档。<strong>判据属于类别，PG 只是该类别判据的输出</strong>——这正是 PG 建模不能脱离 Class 的原因。</p>\n<p>PG 对运输决策的影响可量化，尤其在**限量（LQ）<strong>与</strong>例外数量（EQ）**两条豁免路径上：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PG</th>\n<th>危险程度</th>\n<th>包装指令倾向</th>\n<th>限量/LQ 空间</th>\n<th>空运典型限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>高度</td>\n<td>最严，常禁 LQ</td>\n<td>基本无</td>\n<td>多被禁运或需货运机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II</td>\n<td>中度</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>客机/货机规则不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III</td>\n<td>轻度</td>\n<td>较宽松</td>\n<td>相对大</td>\n<td>更可能适用客机限额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>LQ/EQ 是<strong>运输环节的包装量豁免</strong>，不改变货物危险属性。把它当成「可按普货申报」是常见合规错误——豁免的只是部分包装与文件要求，不是监管本身；且各方式 LQ 阈值并不统一（海运看 IMDG 限量数值，空运看 IATA DGR 的 Y 包装指令），两者不能互换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从分类条目到可计算的危险品主数据\">从分类条目到可计算的危险品主数据</h2><p>把上述三者落成系统，核心是<strong>键 + 属性 + 版本</strong>三层结构。分类键（UN 编号 + 包装形态）、属性（PSN、Class、Division、PG、次要风险、隔离组）、版本（适用法规与生效日期）三者缺一，可运判定就会出错。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[供应商 SDS 第14节 / 商品参数] --&gt; B[归一化&lt;br/&gt;抽取 UN / PSN / Class / PG]&#10;    B --&gt; C{完整性校验}&#10;    C --&gt;|PG 缺失且类别需要| D[退回补录]&#10;    C --&gt;|通过| E[危险品主数据记录&lt;br/&gt;键 = SKU + 包装形态]&#10;    E --&gt; F{按运输方式解析要求}&#10;    F --&gt;|空运| G[IATA DGR 包装指令]&#10;    F --&gt;|海运| H[IMDG 包装指令 + 隔离码]&#10;    F --&gt;|公路| I[ADR 包装代码]&#10;    G --&gt; J[可运方式集合]&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[渠道/平台政策过滤]&#10;    K --&gt; L[最终可下单运输方式]\">graph TD\n    A[供应商 SDS 第14节 / 商品参数] --&gt; B[归一化&lt;br/&gt;抽取 UN / PSN / Class / PG]\n    B --&gt; C{完整性校验}\n    C --&gt;|PG 缺失且类别需要| D[退回补录]\n    C --&gt;|通过| E[危险品主数据记录&lt;br/&gt;键 = SKU + 包装形态]\n    E --&gt; F{按运输方式解析要求}\n    F --&gt;|空运| G[IATA DGR 包装指令]\n    F --&gt;|海运| H[IMDG 包装指令 + 隔离码]\n    F --&gt;|公路| I[ADR 包装代码]\n    G --&gt; J[可运方式集合]\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[渠道/平台政策过滤]\n    K --&gt; L[最终可下单运输方式]</pre><p><strong>校验不变量</strong>至少三条。其一，<strong>类别与 PG 的存在性一致</strong>：第 6.2、7 类不得被强制要求 PG；带 PG 的类别（3、4、5.1、6.1、8 及部分 9 类）PG 为空应报错。其二，<strong>次要风险必须多值</strong>且不与主类别重复。其三，<strong>N.O.S. 条目必须带技术名称</strong>。这三条把大部分脏数据挡在申报之前。</p>\n<p><strong>版本漂移</strong>是长期运行最大的维护成本。橙皮书、IMDG、IATA DGR 各自修订，同一 UN 编号的包装指令或限量阈值会跨版本变化。做法是把法规条目表做成<strong>带生效区间的参考数据（生效于 / 失效于、法规代号、版本号）</strong>，判定时按货物的<strong>实际发运日期</strong>选取适用版本，而不是用系统部署时的&quot;最新版&quot;——这样遇到过渡期窗口也能落到正确那一版。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区与版本陷阱\">常见误区与版本陷阱</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>事实</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Class 9 就是危险度最低</td>\n<td>9 类是兜底类，锂电池等电商高频商品在此，运输限制可能严于 Class 3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PG 为空就是数据错误</td>\n<td>第 6.2、7 类及爆炸品本就没有 PG，字段须允许为空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UN 编号相同就是同一商品</td>\n<td>同一 UN 编号可对应不同 PG、配方、包装形态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用电商平台禁运清单代替法规</td>\n<td>平台政策是<strong>加严</strong>的叠加层，满足平台 ≠ 满足法规与承运人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDS 第 14 节就是权威分类</td>\n<td>SDS 由供应商自填，常见滞后；权威来源是现行有效的运输规则条目表</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>分类不是商品属性，是运输场景的属性</strong>。同一件货，装在设备里发和单独发、空运和海运，落到的条目与要求都可能不同。把它建成一条静态的 SKU 字段，是这类系统最常见的架构性错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分类的根是联合国橙皮书（2023 年第 23 修订版），由 IATA DGR（2026 年第 67 版）、IMDG Code（Amendment 42-24 自 2026-01-01 强制）、ADR（2025 版）转化为强制规则；条目表共享，包装与豁免规则分叉。</li>\n<li>建模第一原则是分层：UN 编号、类别、PG 属于共享的&quot;是什么&quot;，包装指令、限量、隔离码属于按方式分叉的&quot;怎么运&quot;。</li>\n<li>九大类别是危害类型枚举，第 6.2、7 类无 PG，PG 字段须允许为空；次要风险须多值；N.O.S. 条目须带技术名称。</li>\n<li>UN 编号是四位主键，条目分单一/具体/N.O.S. 三类；锂电池条目需单独建表，分类键应为 SKU + 包装形态。</li>\n<li>PG 是同类别的风险强度刻度（Class 3 用闪点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与初沸点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 判定），直接影响 LQ/EQ 空间与空运限制。</li>\n<li>法规版本周期不同步，分类参考数据须带生效区间。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"危险品九大类、UN 编号与包装等级建模","id":"危险品九大类-un-编号与包装等级建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一套分类，三种转化","id":"核心概念-一套分类-三种转化"},{"level":2,"text":"九大类别与分项：危害类型的枚举","id":"九大类别与分项-危害类型的枚举"},{"level":2,"text":"UN 编号：条目键、PSN 与条目类型","id":"un-编号-条目键-psn-与条目类型"},{"level":2,"text":"包装等级：同类别的强度刻度","id":"包装等级-同类别的强度刻度"},{"level":2,"text":"从分类条目到可计算的危险品主数据","id":"从分类条目到可计算的危险品主数据"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区与版本陷阱","id":"常见误区与版本陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"联合国 TDG 蓝本与 IATA DGR/IMDG/ADR 三套法规映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-transport-iata-imdg-lithium-shipping/dg-classification-regulatory-framework/regulatory-framework-iata-imdg-adr-un-model"}}